{"name": "Mazey Village", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>A cozy adventure of rebuilding, exploration, and bringing a forgotten village back to life. \ud83c\udf3f</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After a powerful tornado tears through the land, homes lie in ruins and villagers are separated from their precious belongings. Explore nearby mazes of winding paths and hidden routes, recover what was lost, and help restore the village one step at a time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"332\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1766240/extras/50985128ec968a2802c0c705901ac36e.poster.avif?t=1787144680\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1766240/extras/50985128ec968a2802c0c705901ac36e.webm?t=1787144680\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1766240/extras/50985128ec968a2802c0c705901ac36e.mp4?t=1787144680\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1766240/extras_big/b8465dec3bbf284c214e0feb2ffa99b9.webp?t=1787144680\" height=\"130\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1766240/extras/b8465dec3bbf284c214e0feb2ffa99b9.avif?t=1787144680\" width=\"1560\"/></span><strong>Explore Charming Worlds \u2b50</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Travel through peaceful forests, snowy paths, forgotten ruins, and cozy hidden areas filled with small stories and secrets. Every region holds lost items, friendly creatures, tiny critters, and small moments waiting to be discovered.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u270f\ufe0f Fill your journal map as you journey through the world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\udde9 Solve cozy puzzles using levers, lights, weights, portals, rotating paths and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udc3e Discover and catch adorable critters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfa3 Enjoy fishing, wandering, and relaxed exploration</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"332\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1766240/extras/d84f303c41638253cc048b1643ad2d2d.poster.avif?t=1787144680\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1766240/extras/d84f303c41638253cc048b1643ad2d2d.webm?t=1787144680\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1766240/extras/d84f303c41638253cc048b1643ad2d2d.mp4?t=1787144680\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1766240/extras_big/b8465dec3bbf284c214e0feb2ffa99b9.webp?t=1787144680\" height=\"130\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1766240/extras/b8465dec3bbf284c214e0feb2ffa99b9.avif?t=1787144680\" width=\"1560\"/></span><strong>Restore &amp; Customize Your Village \ud83c\udfd8\ufe0f</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Bring life back to the village by rebuilding homes, decorating freely, and shaping the town into your own creation. Every recovered item and restored house helps the community grow again. </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf43 Decorate interiors and outdoor spaces</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\uddf1 Edit tiles and paths to design your village layout</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\uded2 Visit shops and collect furniture, decorations, and more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfe0 Restore homes and welcome villagers back</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"332\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1766240/extras/b8aa45720be39737d196367c63a20f74.poster.avif?t=1787144680\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1766240/extras/b8aa45720be39737d196367c63a20f74.webm?t=1787144680\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1766240/extras/b8aa45720be39737d196367c63a20f74.mp4?t=1787144680\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1766240/extras_big/73cdf51bd801d8e00e7e42445b40fb68.webp?t=1787144680\" height=\"130\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1766240/extras/73cdf51bd801d8e00e7e42445b40fb68.avif?t=1787144680\" width=\"1560\"/></span><strong>A Living World Full of Cozy Moments \ud83c\udf38</strong> <br/><strong> </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mazey Village is filled with small, heartwarming interactions that make the world feel alive again. Slow down, explore at your own pace, and enjoy the little moments along the way.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udc08 Pet animals and meet friendly creatures</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udcac Talk with villagers and discover their stories</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udc52 Dress up your character with cozy outfits</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2728 Watch the village slowly come back to life</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Are you ready to begin your journey? <strong>The village is waiting for you!</strong><br/><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" height=\"333\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1766240/extras/1592c015b97c3bf3966d23fe4919de73.poster.avif?t=1787144680\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1766240/extras/1592c015b97c3bf3966d23fe4919de73.webm?t=1787144680\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1766240/extras_big/016e039c899cf5cb29adcf999a0f065a.webp?t=1787144680\" height=\"230\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1766240/extras/016e039c899cf5cb29adcf999a0f065a.avif?t=1787144680\" width=\"1560\"/></span> </p> </div>", "short_desc": "Mazey Village is a cozy town-restoring adventure where a tornado scatters homes, villagers, and their precious belongings. Explore surrounding maps to recover lost items, rebuild homes, and bring warmth and life back to the village.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1766240/2256ee4a1928f87173b0ca4f029b6a28e3b33f0f/header_alt_assets_0.jpg?t=1787144680", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Early Access", "Cozy", "Exploration", "Adventure", "Puzzle", "Cute"], "developers": "Slappy Inc.", "publishers": "Slappy Inc.", "release_date": "Aug 5, 2026", "price": "$14.99", "appid": "1766240", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "5 August 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/QiJxZ9ev6qE", "first_seen": 1785880800.0, "review_rank": 161}